are mostly trump counties  you've got fox news broadcasting you  know it's time to go  and open and get back to work but a ton  of their employees are still working  from home what's being said  publicly is not matching up with the  policies that a lot of places are  putting in place  trump continues to say we don't need to  worry about testing and tracing things  are good to go everything's going down  and yet the white house over the last 72  hours has put in place a mandatory mask  policy  and daily testing for more and more  people other than  trump and pence of course they're not  wearing masks so they're  very clearly saying one thing and doing  something very different when it comes  to the policy  behind the scenes meantime i am very  pleased to see  that here in massachusetts we had  very small case growth rate for about  the last 10 days  deaths yesterday were at their lowest  since april 4th which is about  40 days ago lowest deaths in 40 days  was yesterday in massachusetts that's  really really good to see  and we're expecting some new guidance  probably in the next 48 hours  for massachusetts governor charlie baker  who's not been perfect he's been late on  a bunch of stuff  but he's been far earlier than more than  half of the country's governors  we'll see what continues to happen in  the early infection blue states like new  york  new jersey massachusetts california  illinois  and then we're going to be able to  compare and contrast that with place  with places that never really closed  at the state level uh cities may have  done things  and that have been very quick to reopen  we're going to know in the next 20 or 30  days exactly what the repercussions of  that are  early data are that it's not going to be  particularly pretty  one of our sponsors today is vincero  watches giving you 15  off your entire order when you go to  davidpakman.com  slash watch don't pay thousands of  dollars for a high quality watch that  looks great because you don't ha